              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amwĩa Mose, Ũkĩla kĩoko tene ũũngame mbee wa Valao; sisya, nĩwũkĩte manzĩnĩ; naku ũmwĩe, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Lekya andũ makwa mathi, manthũkũme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
